      <h2>How Does Monkey App Work?</h2>

      <p>
        Monkey App is designed to make meeting new people quick and simple through short video conversations. After downloading the app and completing the initial setup, users typically create a basic profile before starting their first chat. Depending on the device being used, the app may request permission to access the camera and microphone so video conversations can begin.
      </p>

      <p>
