      <h2>How Social Discovery Apps Differ from Traditional Social Media</h2>

      <p>
        Traditional social media platforms are usually built around connecting with people you already know, such as friends, family members, classmates, or colleagues. Social discovery apps follow a different approach by introducing users to completely new people through live conversations instead of existing social networks.
      </p>

